mbnail\" title=\"A fat bald white man.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b1/A_fat_bald_white_man..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210122090303\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b1/A_fat_bald_white_man..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210122090303 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b1/A_fat_bald_white_man..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210122090303 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"A fat bald white man.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"A_fat_bald_white_man..png\" data-image-name=\"A fat bald white man..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\">4</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noel_Fielding\" title=\"Noel Fielding\">Noel Fielding</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_F.I.P.\" title=\"The F.I.P.\">The F.I.P.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Look_at_me.\" title=\"Look at me.\">Look at me.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>A fat bald white man.</b></i> is the first episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\">Series 4</a> of <i>Taskmaster</i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 25 April 2017. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Noel_Fielding\" title=\"Noel Fielding\">Noel Fielding</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_fat_bald_white_man.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"A fat bald white man\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> described <a href=\"/wiki/Hugh_Dennis\" title=\"Hugh Dennis\">Hugh Dennis</a> portrait of a black woman, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Create_the_best_caricature_of_the_person_on_the_other_side_of_the_curtain\" title=\"Create the best caricature of the person on the other side of the curtain\">Create the best caricature of the person on the other side of the curtain</a> task. The title card shows a black, broken egg, which may allude to the <a href=\"/wiki/Destroy_this_cake\" title=\"Destroy this cake\">Destroy this cake</a> and/or the <a href=\"/wiki/Fell_all_the_rubber_ducks\" title=\"Fell all the rubber ducks\">Fell all the rubber ducks</a> tasks.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_fat_bald_white_man.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En fed, skaldet, hvid mand', which translates as 'A fat, bald, white man'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Lihava kalju valkoihoinen mamma', which translates as 'Fat bald caucasian mamma'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_fat_bald_white_man.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Hugh_Dennis\" title=\"Hugh Dennis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Hugh Dennis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Lycett\" title=\"Joe Lycett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Lycett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lolly_Adefope\" title=\"Lolly Adefope\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lolly Adefope</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mel_Giedroyc\" title=\"Mel Giedroyc\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mel Giedroyc</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Noel_Fielding\" title=\"Noel Fielding\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Noel Fielding</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_interesting_autograph_on_the_most_interesting_vegetable\" title=\"Most interesting autograph on the most interesting vegetable\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most interesting autograph on the most interesting vegetable.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Destroy_this_cake\" title=\"Destroy this cake\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Destroy this cake.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Create_the_best_caricature_of_the_person_on_the_other_side_of_the_curtain\" title=\"Create the best caricature of the person on the other side of the curtain\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Create the best caricature of the person on the other side of the curtain. You may not look at the person. The person may only say yes and no.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Find out the person's full name..</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fell_all_the_rubber_ducks\" title=\"Fell all the rubber ducks\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Fell all the rubber ducks.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_juice\" title=\"Make the most juice\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Make the most juice. You must pick one fruit and one tool. If you pick the same tool as someone else, you must juice blindfolded. If you pick the same fruit as someone else, you must juice one-handed. If you pick the same fruit and tool as someone else, you must juice blindfolded, one-handed and bouncing up and down.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">18\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_fat_bald_white_man.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_4,_Episode_1_%27A_Fat_Bald_White_Man%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/90/Taskmaster_-_Series_4%2C_Episode_1_%27A_Fat_Bald_White_Man%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003900\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_4,_Episode_1_&#39;A_Fat_Bald_White_Man&#39;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_4,_Episode_1_&#39;A_Fat_Bald_White_Man&#39;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 4, Episode 1 &#39;A Fat